T1  - Exploring the impact of a GenAI-supported writing program on primary students’ writing motivation, engagement, and performance: A mixed methods study
AU  - Lu, Qi
AU  - Wang, Minhong
AU  - Yao, Yuan
AU  - Zhu, Xinhua
